The big update is here (if you haven't noticed it yet)!
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35777794/c3c2cfcb3a4ee793843a98ffc1e027c6e7a7a9c8.png
In this update:

 Significantly updated appearance of the game;
 New visual effects;
 Added new sounds;
 Fixed bugs, in particular doors that did not always open;
 Updated game engine.

Dear players!
The project recently had a Beta branch. Initially, it is in this branch that new builds of the game will be submitted. Anyone can join beta testing of new versions.

In the new version available now you can evaluate:

 HDR support;
 Supports ambient lighting in screen space;
 Acceleration of rendering on modern video cards of a low price category.
